    "maintainer_can_modify": false,
    "title": "doc: fix createwallet positional example, descriptors must be true",
    "user": {
      "login": "treib-holdings",
      "id": 265589794,
      "node_id": "U_kgDOD9SUIg",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265589794?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/treib-holdings",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/treib-holdings/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "The createwallet example in doc/JSON-RPC-interface.md passes false as the sixth positional argument `descriptors`. Since v30.0, legacy wallets can no longer be created, so the example fails as written:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ bitcoin-cli -regtest createwallet mywallet false false \"\" false false true\r\nerror code: -4\r\nerror message:\r\ndescriptors argument must be set to \"true\"; it is no longer possible to create a legacy wallet.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis changes the argument to true in both the comment and the command. The example still shows positional arguments, including load_on_startup as the seventh, and with the change it creates the wallet without error. Tested with v31.1 on regtest.\r\n\r\nNo code or tests are affected, this is a documentation only change.",
    "labels": [
      {
